"I'm scared there's no safe place for my bitcoin."

Security is not a binary attribute. You are always making trade-offs between convenience of your own access &amp; inconvenience of unauthorized access.

The only perfectly secure BTC is that which you send to an unspendable script.

@TeddyE_ If you're gonna do 20 you might as well do 100.

@ibenaija That won't help anything. Everyone makes mistakes; bitcoin users should assume that vendors will screw up and architect their setup to be robust against such failures.
https://t.co/ODsIcknrQD

Should you lose faith in self custody due to recent events? I think not.

Third party custodians are also susceptible to weak RNGs. Interestingly enough, COLDCARD is one of the few devices that support dice rolls (along with seedsigner and krux.)
